    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0309" n="137" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg137"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 012/10512</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Sofia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Murphy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sofia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-18T15:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 18, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 20, 8.05
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>121. Bulgarian Minister of Foreign Affairs requests the following be handed to
                    Minister Panaretoff:<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d144-f1"/>
                    <pb facs="0310" n="138" xml:id="pg138"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Your communication No. 41 was delivered to me thanks to the kind
                            intervention of the American Consul General at Sofia. I request you to
                            declare to the Honorable the Government of the United States on behalf
                            of the Royal Government that Bulgaria intends also on her part to
                            preserve the relations of perfect friendship that she has always been
                            happy to maintain with the United States. Signed, Radoslavoff.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Murphy</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d144-f1" n="1" xml:id="d144-f1-content">
                <p>Paraphrase transmitted to Minister Panaretoff, Feb. 21, and formally communicated by him to the
                    Secretary of State, Feb. 23.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
